1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,000
The flag is flying, announcing complete independence.

2
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:22,000
The nation rises up, because of the faith we have in this our Comoria.

3
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:33,000
Let us always have devotion, to love our great islands.

4
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:43,000
We Comorians are of one blood; we Comorians are of one faith.

5
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:47,000
On these islands we were born, these islands brought us up.

6
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:53,000
May God always help us; let us always have the firm resolve.

7
00:00:54,000 --> 00:01:00,000
To love our fatherland, love our religion, and the world.

8
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:10,000
The flag is flying; from the sixth of July the nation rises up.

9
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:24,000
Our islands are lined up: Mayotte and Anjouan, Moheli, and N'Gazidja.

10
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:34,000
Let us always have devotion to love our great islands!